== Walkthrough ==

''[[Tylfon]] is located at -515, -229, 161 in the Scouts of Tunare ([[Rogue]]) Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Tylfon'

: Tylfon says, 'You [dare] to speak with a loyal member of the Scouts of Tunare?!! You are truly foolish!! Run away while you still can.'

'''Hand [[Tylfon]] [[a tattered note]]'''

:: ''a tattered note reads:''

:: <code>Hail friend. I have use of someone with your skills and talents. Please, return this letter to me and join our cause. In return for your help, I will help train you and teach you the ways of our small association. --Tylfon</code>

: Tylfon says, 'Hmm.. I hope you can prove yourself a lot more valuable than you look. Here, throw this on.. It'll help protect you a little.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Tunare's Scouts]] got better.
</div>

